;Description
:This template will hide sections of articles that are extremely long and requires the {{t|Collapsible}} template.
;Syntax
:Type <code><nowiki>{{LongSection|text=...}}</nowiki></code> at the start of an article.
:NOTE: if the text attribute is ignored this will work more like {{t|Stub}} and you will need to apply the collapsible section yourself

